{"id":199095046,"slug":"the-water-park","title":"The Water Park","subtitle":"An unexpected opportunity to feel more carefree, with a hat tip to implantable therapies.","post_date":"2026-05-25T14:04:05.208Z","audience":"everyone","type":"newsletter","canonical_url":"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/the-water-park","wordcount":1123,"source":"api","fetched_at":"2026-09-13T21:43:52.149Z","body_sha256":"3df2f6b248859634b62f46c7ffcd80df9a6c05ad70bbafa5f88e60cc7ddcb9c8","text_words":1105,"complete":true,"body_html":"<p>If you've ever wondered if a water park could be made absent a focus on wetness by any contrivances of mankind?  I ask you to look no further than the <a href=\"https://www.americandream.com\">American Dream</a> Mall.</p><p>To be frank, with you, dear readers, I kind of love water parks.  This love is relative.  I hate roller coasters.   I'm scared of heights.  There's something, however, about the height giving way to the risk for “slip and fall” injuries of a water ride that I find, perhaps perplexingly, soothing.   It's as if the near certainty of yet another ankle sprain is enough to lull me into a sense of complacency when it comes to my certain death from the myriad potential falls that offered to end my time on earth.  Except in this case, it's not a conceptual fall—it's a literal waterfall.  For those who grew up in the northeast, you might remember the most notorious of the “prone to kill you water parks”— <a href=\"https://www.classactionpark.com/\">Action Park in Vernon, New Jersey.</a>  This theoretically safe park was among the more dangerous places I remember— there was a 30 foot cliff dive, a 20 foot cliff dive, and an entire documentary (“Class Action Park”) dedicated to its lethality and penchant for civil litigation.  Action Park, in retrospect, seems quaint— well intentioned, even.  This is not to say the American Dream water park is dangerous, per se.</p><p>The American Dream Mall, perhaps unsurprisingly, is also in New Jersey.  Many things that haunt men's dreams are from New Jersey.  What follows is the view from directly below the photo you're looking at, where I sit drafting this article.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!uz12!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F59a5ce55-7209-4983-ab2c-98df80f23e9e_4032x3024.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!uz12!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F59a5ce55-7209-4983-ab2c-98df80f23e9e_4032x3024.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!uz12!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F59a5ce55-7209-4983-ab2c-98df80f23e9e_4032x3024.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!uz12!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F59a5ce55-7209-4983-ab2c-98df80f23e9e_4032x3024.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!uz12!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F59a5ce55-7209-4983-ab2c-98df80f23e9e_4032x3024.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!uz12!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F59a5ce55-7209-4983-ab2c-98df80f23e9e_4032x3024.jpeg\" width=\"531\" height=\"707.878434065934\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/59a5ce55-7209-4983-ab2c-98df80f23e9e_4032x3024.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:1941,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:531,&quot;bytes&quot;:3297224,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/i/199095046?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F59a5ce55-7209-4983-ab2c-98df80f23e9e_4032x3024.jpeg&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!uz12!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F59a5ce55-7209-4983-ab2c-98df80f23e9e_4032x3024.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!uz12!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F59a5ce55-7209-4983-ab2c-98df80f23e9e_4032x3024.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!uz12!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F59a5ce55-7209-4983-ab2c-98df80f23e9e_4032x3024.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!uz12!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F59a5ce55-7209-4983-ab2c-98df80f23e9e_4032x3024.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>Here at the American Dream Mall, not content to charge only $99 a ticket per person, they have decided to extract additional revenue through clever-ish fees paid by its branded sponsor—DreamWorks, of \"Kung Fu Panda” fame.  Here I write, after I already slipped once on the way to our precious few seats, under the watchful eye of Shrek.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Z0mj!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa546e6fc-2e41-4b3b-8aac-57b28fbe2ab4_4032x3024.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Z0mj!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa546e6fc-2e41-4b3b-8aac-57b28fbe2ab4_4032x3024.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Z0mj!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa546e6fc-2e41-4b3b-8aac-57b28fbe2ab4_4032x3024.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Z0mj!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa546e6fc-2e41-4b3b-8aac-57b28fbe2ab4_4032x3024.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Z0mj!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa546e6fc-2e41-4b3b-8aac-57b28fbe2ab4_4032x3024.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Z0mj!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa546e6fc-2e41-4b3b-8aac-57b28fbe2ab4_4032x3024.jpeg\" width=\"561\" height=\"420.75\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/a546e6fc-2e41-4b3b-8aac-57b28fbe2ab4_4032x3024.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:1092,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:561,&quot;bytes&quot;:2200460,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/i/199095046?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa546e6fc-2e41-4b3b-8aac-57b28fbe2ab4_4032x3024.jpeg&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Z0mj!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa546e6fc-2e41-4b3b-8aac-57b28fbe2ab4_4032x3024.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Z0mj!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa546e6fc-2e41-4b3b-8aac-57b28fbe2ab4_4032x3024.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Z0mj!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa546e6fc-2e41-4b3b-8aac-57b28fbe2ab4_4032x3024.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Z0mj!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa546e6fc-2e41-4b3b-8aac-57b28fbe2ab4_4032x3024.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>Going to a waterpark as a young-enough person is relatively straightforward.  My children are 10, and they don't have a phone.  Only my son has a watch.  We were only able to find two chairs, and so instead of leaving our valuables—in this case of phone to be able to respond to acute emergencies for patients, on my way into the park—I plopped into the scarce chairs while mother and children frolic.</p><p>To be very clear, this place is large.  It’s self-reportedly the largest indoor theme-park in North America.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!rluA!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1a93cec8-5bda-471e-956b-a813692bfaab_4032x3024.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!rluA!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1a93cec8-5bda-471e-956b-a813692bfaab_4032x3024.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!rluA!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1a93cec8-5bda-471e-956b-a813692bfaab_4032x3024.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!rluA!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1a93cec8-5bda-471e-956b-a813692bfaab_4032x3024.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!rluA!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1a93cec8-5bda-471e-956b-a813692bfaab_4032x3024.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!rluA!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1a93cec8-5bda-471e-956b-a813692bfaab_4032x3024.jpeg\" width=\"617\" height=\"462.75\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/1a93cec8-5bda-471e-956b-a813692bfaab_4032x3024.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:1092,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:617,&quot;bytes&quot;:4160254,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/i/199095046?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1a93cec8-5bda-471e-956b-a813692bfaab_4032x3024.jpeg&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!rluA!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1a93cec8-5bda-471e-956b-a813692bfaab_4032x3024.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!rluA!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1a93cec8-5bda-471e-956b-a813692bfaab_4032x3024.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!rluA!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1a93cec8-5bda-471e-956b-a813692bfaab_4032x3024.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!rluA!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1a93cec8-5bda-471e-956b-a813692bfaab_4032x3024.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>I'm not convinced that, after years of atrophy at the hands of my cellular phone, I could come up with any rational plan that would allow for the family to meet up or check-in with each other other absent these devices.  What am I, going bring a compass, like a goddamn savage?   What would Shrek, or his friend, Donkey, think of me then?  Their paired gaze is all knowing, all seeing, and oppressive.</p><p>I've got a pretty simple goal today. Last time I was here, <a href=\"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/i-lost-my-glasses-but-not-my-marbles?utm_source=publication-search\">I made the dubious tries to go down a waterslide while trying to keep my glasses safely in my pocket.  That day, I lost my glasses</a>.  It was just about two years ago, and I'm wearing the same pair of replacement glasses ever since.  I don't have room for error.  I'm gonna keep my glasses, and that means saving my seat.  I need to build enough credit with my wife so that when my children want to go on the next waterslide, and I wish go with them, I can go, glasses free, and have some hope that I can stumble back, both wet and blind, to restored vision and a towel.</p><p>For many of us with disabilities, we are tethered to things beyond our control.  I have to take my medicine for my blood pressure every night, along with my post-traumatic stress disorder medicine—thank you, <a href=\"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/prazosin?utm_source=publication-search\">prazosin</a>!—my weekly injections of tirzepetide, my Q12 week injections of Skyrizi, and find a way to let my specialty pharmacy know where I am on delivery dates of all these things.  I need to live somewhere that's near a fridge, such that these meditations can be safely stored.</p><p>I can be as carefree as you can imagine, as long as I have my refrigerated injectables nearby, as long as I have my cell phone, as long as I can get my recommended dose of prescription medication that should not be discontinued abruptly.</p><p>This park was, doubtless, imagined for people other than myself.  People who are steady of foot, unencumbered, <em>carefree</em>.  </p><p>One could think of this waterpark as <em>not</em> accessible, but I'm here, enjoying myself.  I'll get to ride that waterpark attractions later, zooming around the slides—it will be a blast.  </p><p>But for those stricken with mood, metabolic, inflammatory, heart conduction, or movement disorders?  The DreamWorks waterpark has another message, aside from the value of the brand associated with Shrek.  It's a giant labyrinthine structure that might as well be advertising for “implanted therapies.”</p><p>What if my autoimmune problems didn’t take oral meds and refrigerated injections—but instead could be carried inside me, neuromodulating my way to comfort?</p><p><a href=\"https://open.substack.com/pub/thefrontierpsychiatrists/p/vagus-nerve-stimulation-for-rheumatoid?r=1ct8f&amp;utm_campaign=post-expanded-share&amp;utm_medium=web\">That is a real thing now!</a></p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Q1J7!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2d6bc218-709f-465c-8f20-d8333198cae0_1320x880.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Q1J7!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2d6bc218-709f-465c-8f20-d8333198cae0_1320x880.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Q1J7!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2d6bc218-709f-465c-8f20-d8333198cae0_1320x880.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Q1J7!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2d6bc218-709f-465c-8f20-d8333198cae0_1320x880.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Q1J7!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F